AbraFlexi Zabbix Monitoring Configuration Template
=====================================================

# Copy this file to /etc/abraflexi-zabbix/.env and configure your settings

# AbraFlexi server URL (required)
# Example: https://demo.flexibee.eu:5434
ABRAFLEXI_URL=

# AbraFlexi API username (required)  
# Example: winstrom
ABRAFLEXI_LOGIN=

# AbraFlexi API password (required)
# Example: winstrom  
ABRAFLEXI_PASSWORD=

# Optional: Request timeout in seconds (default: 30)
# ABRAFLEXI_TIMEOUT=30

# Optional: Debug mode (uncomment for verbose logging)
# DEBUG=1